        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rihanna, Jamal Jones, Ester Dean, Tor Erik Hermansen, Mikkel Eriksen, Shaffer Smith\n- Products: \"Fading\", \"Take a Bow\", Loud, Good Girl Gone Bad\n- Roles: Polow da Don, StarGate, Ne-Yo\n\nFacts:\n- Rihanna's third studio album Good Girl Gone Bad was released in 2007.\n- \"Take a Bow\" is a song recorded by Barbadian singer Rihanna for the 2008 re-release of Good Girl Gone Bad.\n- \"Take a Bow\" was written and produced by Tor Erik Hermansen, Mikkel Eriksen, and Shaffer Smith under the stage names StarGate and Ne-Yo.\n- Rihanna's fifth studio album Loud was released in 2010.\n- \"Fading\" is a song by Barbadian recording artist Rihanna from her fifth studio album Loud.\n- \"Fading\" was written by Jamal Jones and Ester Dean.\n- \"Fading\" was produced by Jamal Jones under his production name Polow da Don.",
